  "semantic_evidence": [
    {
      "finding": "The requested objects are ranked contributor companies, so companyName supplies the requested identity. Counts establish the ranking but are not separately requested result roles. The RRC ownership parenthetical states the application purpose; it does not ask who legally owns RRC, an IPR owner, a normative approving body, or a patent share. This review neither adds such fields nor asserts those facts.",
      "original_quote": "Rank the main contributors",
      "query_clauses": [
